<title>ISRAEL: Israel's economic performance index up 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Israel's economic performance index up 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's economic performance or &quot;S&quot; index rose 0.1 percent in April, the Bank of Israel said.</p>
<p>				April 97   March 97   April 96</p>
<p>Month-on-month change   + 0.1	+ 0.9	+ 0.8</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1994)   118.4	118.3	117.1</p>
<p>The &quot;S&quot; index is made up of three components: retail sales, which were unchanged in April; imports, which fell 12.0 percent in April; and industrial production, which rose 0.4 percent in March.</p>
<p>Note: figures for industrial production lag one month.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom 972-3-537-2211</p>
